flowchart TD
  classDef input fill:#FEF3C7,stroke:#D97706,color:#78350F,stroke-width:2px
  classDef agent fill:#F3E8FF,stroke:#7C3AED,color:#581C87,stroke-width:2px
  classDef output fill:#DBEAFE,stroke:#2563EB,color:#1E3A8A,stroke-width:2px
  classDef fallback fill:#FEE2E2,stroke:#DC2626,color:#7F1D1D,stroke-width:2px

  A[종목코드\n예: 005930]:::input --> B[기술적 분석 에이전트\n차트·거래량·패턴]:::agent
  B --> C[뉴스 분석 에이전트\n호재·악재·시장 반응]:::agent
  C --> D[투자전략 에이전트\nBUY/HOLD/PASS + 점수]:::agent
  D --> E[analysis 결과 dict\nrecommendation, score, reason, risk]:::output

  X{LLM 연결됨?}:::input -->|예| B
  X -->|아니오| Y[mock 응답으로 폴백\n수업 중 흐름 먼저 체험]:::fallback
  Y --> E
